<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Representational Alignment Across Model Layers and Brain Regions with Hierarchical Optimal Transport" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Representation Similarity between Vision Models and Vision Cortex</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Representational Alignment Across Model Layers and Brain Regions with Hierarchical Optimal Transport" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Use of Large Language Models</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
