<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Comparing LLM-LLM Representations</h2>

<figure id="A1.F1" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/LLMs/Llama_1B-Llama_3B.png" id="A1.F1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/LLMs/Qwen_0.5B-Qwen_3B.png" id="A1.F1.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/LLMs/Qwen_0.5B-Llama_1B.png" id="A1.F1.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/LLMs/Qwen_0.5B-Llama_3B.png" id="A1.F1.g4" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/LLMs/Llama_1B-Qwen_3B.png" id="A1.F1.g5" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/LLMs/Llama_3B-Qwen_3B.png" id="A1.F1.g6" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure A.1: </span><span id="A1.F1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Transport plans across LLM families and scales.</span>
Hierarchical OT (HOT) mappings are shown for six cross-model comparisons:
(a) LLaMA-3.2 1B <math id="A1.F1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> LLaMA-3.2 3B,
(b) Qwen-2.5 0.5B <math id="A1.F1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Qwen-2.5 3B,
(c) Qwen-2.5 0.5B <math id="A1.F1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> LLaMA-3.2 1B,
(d) Qwen-2.5 0.5B <math id="A1.F1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> LLaMA-3.2 3B,
(e) LLaMA-3.2 1B <math id="A1.F1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Qwen-2.5 3B, and
(f) LLaMA-3.2 3B <math id="A1.F1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Qwen-2.5 3B.
HOT uncovers structured, near-diagonal correspondences that persist across both intra-family (a,b) and cross-family (c-f) alignments, illustrating its robustness compared to pairwise OT.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
