<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Transport plans for OT based mapping pairs</h3>

<figure id="A2.F1" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/FMRIs/Subject_A-Subject_B.png" id="A2.F1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/FMRIs/Subject_A-Subject_C.png" id="A2.F1.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/FMRIs/Subject_A-Subject_D.png" id="A2.F1.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/FMRIs/Subject_B-Subject_C.png" id="A2.F1.g4" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/FMRIs/Subject_B-Subject_D.png" id="A2.F1.g5" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><img src="2510.01706v1/Figures/FMRIs/Subject_C-Subject_D.png" id="A2.F1.g6" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:264/113;" width="264" height="113" alt="Refer to caption"></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure B.1: </span><span id="A2.F1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Transport plans for OT-based mapping pairs.</span>
Pairwise OT mappings across all subject pairs:
(a) Subject A <math id="A2.F1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Subject B,
(b) Subject A <math id="A2.F1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Subject C,
(c) Subject A <math id="A2.F1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Subject D,
(d) Subject B <math id="A2.F1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Subject C,
(e) Subject B <math id="A2.F1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Subject D, and
(f) Subject C <math id="A2.F1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leftrightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↔</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leftrightarrow</annotation></semantics></math> Subject D.
HOT recovers structured region-to-region correspondences that are absent in pairwise OT. </figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
