<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Use of Large Language Models</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">LLMs were used in this work to assist with writing tasks, specifically for ensuring grammatical correctness and enhancing the clarity of the text.</p>
</div>
